[{"client_msg_id":"1b86f30f-da9d-4481-a74e-da98e277dfb0","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"まあ少なくともメーカー側からすると配信による販促の影響は小さいという判断になったんだろうなと。\nただ、あくまで自分基準だと配信とか動画見て面白そうと思ってゲーム買うことが多い人間(最近はそればっか)なので\n配信見てやりたくならないゲームはどっちにしろその人は買わないんじゃないかと思ったりしてます。","ts":"1634042581.426100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c6auw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34331e09-e4d9-420d-858c-021dfb294559","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"僕にとっては夜回りもそうだった。自分で体験したいっていう風にならなかった。","ts":"1634038854.424500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W6Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c95d193-2128-43b6-8c87-9e54cc4d1adc","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"盲目の王子のやつと勇者のやつ","ts":"1634038797.423700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yZHp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67f9a44e-0563-4eea-bc01-ad33cbce3ad8","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"絵本風のやつとかはまさにそんな感じしますね","ts":"1634038767.422900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f4FL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6cdae856-e8b3-4272-a828-2cf7ee387efd","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"でも日本一のゲームって、どっちかっていうと配信で見ちゃったら買わないで良いやっていうタイプのゲームじゃない?","ts":"1634038372.422500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5bkZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e273fb4-de50-4a3b-8150-b52278edfc14","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"どうなるんでしょうねー、日本一はソフトが高くユーザーがニッチなので知ってもらうことが大事だと思うけれど。","ts":"1634034713.421600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nTA7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fde4696d-489c-45bb-a151-a006411e67a1","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"日本一ソフトウェアと言えば、夜回りがもう